{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40848","headline":"题妓莱儿壁 · 赵光远","name":"题妓莱儿壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鱼钥兽环斜掩门，萋萋芳草忆王孙。\n醉凭青琐窥韩寿，闲掷金梭恼谢鲲。\n不夜珠光连玉匣，辟寒钗影落瑶尊。\n欲知肠断相思处，役尽江淹别後魂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵光远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40848.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40848","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}